🧠 Interview Tip

Ask yourself:

Am I transforming the entire stream or transforming elements inside another collector?

Transforming the stream → map()
Transforming within groupingBy(), partitioningBy(), etc. → Collectors.mapping()
⭐ Remember Forever
Situation	Use
Before collect()	map() ✅
Inside another collector	Collectors.mapping() ✅

